+-- # Changelog
+-- 
+--+## Unreleased
+--+
+--+- Normalize implementation files under `src/` and replace the Python benchmark
+--+  driver with a native Kujo harness.
+--+- Add sparse candidate scoring, bounded nearest-neighbor retention, aggregate
+--+  input-byte and candidate-pair budgets, and transactional run publication.
+--+- Make source identifiers portable, link opportunities directional, related
+--+  results ranked, comparisons relationship-aware, GraphML standards-compliant,
+--+  and export overwrites explicit.
+--+- Expand adversarial, portability, budget, comparison, and export tests and
+--+  document operational boundaries without overstating enterprise certification.
+--+
+-- ## 0.1.0 - 2026-08-11
+-- 
+-- - Initial deterministic lexical content graph, clustering, overlaps, orphans, link opportunities, portfolio evidence, and comparison contracts.
+--diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
